---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Use | Kvisl" description="Terms for using the Kvisl website.">
  <main class="container page-main narrow-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Use</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Use</h1>
    <div class="policy-copy">
      <p>You may share links and quote reasonable excerpts from <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> articles when the quotation preserves context and identifies the author, article title, and source.</p>
      <p>Do not scrape, mirror, or republish the site at scale, and do not impersonate <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span>, its authors, or its editors. Full republication, translation, adaptation, syndication, and commercial reuse require written permission and a paid licence.</p>
      <p>Our work is published for general reading and research discussion. It is not medical, legal, investment, or other professional advice.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
